### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

###

### Get Tally registrations
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/admin/tally/registrations

###

### Get first 10 registrations
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/admin/tally/registrations?page=1&limit=10

###

### Get next 10
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/admin/tally/registrations?page=2&limit=10